OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLow cloud quickly lifting to
OL,6,Fbright spells and a scattering of
OL,7,Fshowers. Cloud amounts increasing in
OL,8,Fthe north as rain moves in from the
OL,9,Fnorthwest by late afternoon. Feeling
OL,10,Fpleasant where the sun holds on in the
OL,11,Fsouth.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain, heavy at times, will
OL,14,Fmove southeastwards across the region
OL,15,Fthrough the evening. Staying cloudy
OL,16,Fovernight, with further spells of
OL,17,Flight rain and drizzle.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
